OL,3,CFormer mayor took his own life
OL,4,Cfollowing arrest, inquest hears
OL,6,FA former mayor took his own life after
OL,7,Fhe was arrested on suspicion of an
OL,8,Fonline sex offence.
OL,10,FCllr Cahal Burke was found
OL,11,Funresponsive at his home in
OL,12,FHuddersfield in March, an inquest
OL,13,Fheard.
OL,15,FThe former Kirklees Council mayor had
OL,16,Ftaken a large number of tablets when
OL,17,Fhe was discovered, having written a
OL,18,Fnote to his family which indicated his
OL,19,Fintention to end his life.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
