OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786744251
OL,3,CFormer mayor took his own life
OL,4,Cfollowing arrest, inquest hears
OL,6,FThe inquest heard Mr Burke had typed
OL,7,Fthe note before his death, claiming he
OL,8,Fwanted to be reunited with his late
OL,9,Fmother.
OL,11,FMr Burke served as mayor for the West
OL,12,FYorkshire council from 2023, as well
OL,13,Fas representing the Lindley ward as a
OL,14,FLiberal Democrat councillor from 2010.
OL,16,FHe was suspended by the party five
OL,17,Fdays before he was found dead,
OL,18,Fsubsequently listed as an independent.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
