FL,339,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786744251
OL,3,CFormer mayor took his own life
OL,4,Cfollowing arrest, inquest hears
OL,6,FAt the time of his death, he was on
OL,7,Fbail after having been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of an online sexual offence.
OL,10,FAssistant coroner Charlotte Keighley
OL,11,Fconcluded in a written inquest that Mr
OL,12,FBurke had died by suicide, listing his
OL,13,Fcause of death as toxicity.
OL,15,FThe verdict stated: "On the 9th March
OL,16,F2026, Cahal Colin William Burke was
OL,17,Ffound in a collapsed and unresponsive
OL,18,Fcondition, in bed, at his home address
OL,19,Fof... Dean Street, Huddersfield,
OL,20,Fhaving consumed a large number of
OL,21,Ftablets.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
