FL,339,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786744251
OL,3,CFormer mayor took his own life
OL,4,Cfollowing arrest, inquest hears
OL,6,F"Paramedics from the Yorkshire
OL,7,FAmbulance Service attended and Cahal's
OL,8,Fdeath was confirmed at 10:13 hours the
OL,9,Fsame day.
OL,11,F"At some point prior to his death,
OL,12,FCahal had typed a note to his family,
OL,13,Findicating his intention to take his
OL,14,Fown life and to be reunited with his
OL,15,Fmother.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
