PN,33805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F338A1786744251
OL,3,CFormer mayor took his own life
OL,4,Cfollowing arrest, inquest hears
OL,6,F"Given the circumstances in which
OL,7,FCahal was found and his stated
OL,8,Fintention to be with his mother, it is
OL,9,Fmore likely than not that at the time
OL,10,FCahal consumed the tablets, he did so
OL,11,Fwith the intention of taking his own
OL,12,Flife."
OL,14,FFollowing the verdict, a spokesperson
OL,15,Ffor West Yorkshire Police said the
OL,16,Fforce was continuing enquiries as part
OL,17,Fof its safeguarding responsibilities.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@FO]
